# User Data, Dictionaries & Privacy (Security)
# !! CRITICAL: Never commit user dictionaries, learning data, or language models !!
*.bin
*.gguf
*.tgz
*.cache
user_dict.txt
user_dictionary/
learning_cache/
# The real names the app uses. `learning_cache/` and `user_dictionary/` above
# match neither, so a cache copied into the repo to debug something — the
# obvious thing to do — would have been committed by `git add .`. The live files
# live in ~/Library and never inside the tree, but the foot-gun is worth closing:
# learning.tsv is a record of everything the user has typed.
learning.tsv
learning.key
user_dicts/
custom_dict/
private/
secret/
*.log

# Except for tracked static data
data/
!kashiko-engine/data/

